<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Home</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">

</head>

<body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>
    <main id="main-content" role="main">
        <h1>
            <%= title %>
        </h1>
    
        <!-- Hero / Intro -->
        <section class="hero">
            <h2>Welcome to Our Service Project Hub</h2>
            <p>
                Discover opportunities to learn, serve, and grow. This site is your starting point
                for exploring projects that make a difference in the environment, education,
                community, and health.
            </p>
        </section>
    
        <!-- About section -->
        <section class="about">
            <h2>About This Site</h2>
            <p>
                Our mission is to connect people with meaningful projects. Whether you’re looking
                to volunteer, gain experience, or simply learn more, each category highlights
                ways you can contribute and grow.
            </p>
            <p>
                Built with modern web technologies, this site is part of our CSE 340 coursework
                and demonstrates how backend development can power dynamic, community‑focused
                applications.
            </p>
        </section>
    
        <!-- Categories preview -->
        <section class="categories">
            <h2>Explore Categories</h2>
            <div class="categories-grid">
                <article>
                    <h3>Environmental</h3>
                    <p>Join sustainability projects, conservation efforts, and eco‑friendly initiatives.</p>
                </article>
                <article>
                    <h3>Educational</h3>
                    <p>Support learning programs, tutoring, and resources for students of all ages.</p>
                </article>
                <article>
                    <h3>Community Service</h3>
                    <p>Volunteer in local projects that strengthen neighborhoods and build connections.</p>
                </article>
                <article>
                    <h3>Health and Wellness</h3>
                    <p>Promote physical, mental, and social well‑being through workshops and activities.</p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>
    
        <!-- Call to action -->
        <section class="cta">
            <h2>Get Involved Today</h2>
            <p>
                Explore the categories above to learn more. Each page will provide details,
                upcoming opportunities, and ways to participate. Together, we can make a lasting impact.
            </p>
            <a href="/categories" class="button">View All Categories</a>
        </section>
    </main>
      
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>

</html>